WEBVTT

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.170
<i>I promise.</i>

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:10.010
<i>Someday in the future, I will become your wife.</i>

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.360
Yukiji...

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.170
When in the future?

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.170
How long do I have to wait?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.860
Ah! What's wrong, Tomoe?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.200
Did you have a scary dream?

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.660
It's not scary.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.220
Not anymore.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.920
What was that?

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.850
It sounded like a meteor falling.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:37.760
Outside?

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.730
What's happening?

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.770
It seems we have a celestial guest.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.590
Celestial guest?

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.590
Hello, my friends.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.860
Are you all here?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.920
It's me.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.280
Lord Ookuninushi!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.860
I never expected to see you here!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:58.000
You're making a scene. If you need something, use the door.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.290
What a greeting, my fine fox.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:05.290
I am here to take on Kuromaro's last job.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.470
Kuromaro?

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.970
I grieve for my old friend.

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.040
Fox.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:20.540
In that god's stead, I, Ookuninushi, shall make you human.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.310
Human?

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.860
Do you really mean it, Lord Ookuninushi?

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:25.810
I do.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.410
Tomoe can become human!

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.560
Human!

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.070
Please hold on.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.570
With all due respect, Lord Ookuninushi...

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.570
Tomoe is not yet ready to live as a human.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.060
Mikage!

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.580
And Nanami, too,

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.310
hasn't yet decided how to spend her life with Tomoe after he has become human.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.400
Mikage...

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:52.620
Nanami, spending your life with Tomoe as human

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:58.340
means living not as a land god, but as a human girl.

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:02.010
That's true. Mikage has the right of it.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:08.330
So could you please wait until these two have figured out their future together?

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.070
Very well. And when would that be?

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.110
Please give us one year.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:17.110
Until we've graduated from high school.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.940
<i>It's been one year since then.</i>

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.320
<i>Tomorrow is the day of the promise with Lord Ookuninushi.</i>

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.590
<i>And...</i>

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.350
<i>It's the day Tomoe becomes human.</i>

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.390
<i>I'm going to relinquish my mark of godhood</i>

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.860
<i>and leave the shrine together with Tomoe.</i>

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.610
This is the new sake, Lord Mikage.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.070
It turned out well, as usual.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.960
Hooray!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.640
It will soon be one year since that day.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.720
Yes, it's almost the day of the promise with Lord Ookuninushi.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.410
You stopped them back then,

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.810
but Nanami and Tomoe have faced the future together ever since.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:15.780
Indeed.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:19.220
I have no reason to stop them anymore.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.880
Feels kind of lonely.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.820
It feels really lonely!

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.140
That hurts.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.040
I'm not a part of Nanami's future.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.800
That's not true.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.610
Bonds aren't broken that easily.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:35.400
You may part ways now, but continue believing in your bond.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:40.730
Hearing that from the god of bringing people together makes me a bit happier.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.160
Hey, fox.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:47.660
How's the preparations for becoming human coming along?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:50.160
Don't ignore me!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.660
Well, aren't you great.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.920
I probably wouldn't be able to do what you're about to.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.670
<i>I don't have the determination.</i>

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.810
If it isn't the tengu. Did you bring something good to eat with you?

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:02.960
I got nothing.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.440
Then what did you come for?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.660
What's you guys' problem? Where is Nanami?

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.530
She's out.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:09.090
With who?

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.930
Kei and Ami.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.280
Ami?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.330
They're graduating tomorrow.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.760
They'll all be forging their own paths.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.940
We'll also have to say goodbye tomorrow.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.450
I'm heading back to my mountain, after all.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.200
I'll be staying at the Mikage shrine.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.620
And I'm becoming human.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.210
Now that I think about it,
we sure met in a strange way.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.880
Drawn to a girl named Nanami.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.810
And before we knew it, we were acting like we were friends.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.730
Since we're here already, why don't we settle things once and for all?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.550
The Three-Way Drinking Championship.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.970
All right!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:44.970
Fine by me.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.940
We've got a long night ahead of us.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.220
Bye, Kei! Bye, Ami!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.480
See you at school tomorrow!

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.450
Thanks for seeing us home!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.010
See you tomorrow!

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.220
Aw, what a shame.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.840
We won't be able to use that handy ride anymore.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:02.990
Kei...

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.790
I'm getting nervous thinking about tomorrow.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.240
Lady Nanami.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:14.570
Your companions weren't able to see us, were they?

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:20.000
When you become human again, we will likewise disappear from your sight.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:25.200
Even if you cannot see us, please do not forget about us!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:31.510
Both I and Kotetsu will always be watching over you, Lady Nanami.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.520
Right... I won't be able to...

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.650
I'll never forget about you!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.830
I love you both!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.520
Lady Nanami!

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:44.380
<i>We're leaving behind so many precious things.</i>

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:47.580
<i>We have to make sure to become happy in return.</i>

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:52.510
<i>We have to lead a full life without doubts.</i>

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.410
<i>Right, Tomoe?</i>

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:57.920
Hey, fox, don't you dare look down on me.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:03.080
I'm just pitying your celibate future of being surrounded by men.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:08.680
I, on the other hand, will be spending my remaining days
doing nothing but flirting with Nanami. You jealous?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.870
Stupid, it's not like I won't...

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.940
Hey, are you already down, snake?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.800
The snake loses!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.690
Bring some more sake!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.690
<i>Right, Tomoe?</i>

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.850
<i>This is our last night at the Mikage shrine,</i>

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.980
<i>and the three of you are getting drunk?</i>

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.190
<i>Idiots!</i>

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.030
You say you'll become human without a second thought...

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.030
But you know, living in the human world

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:31.030
is su—

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.740
—per difficult.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.450
Hey!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:39.100
It seems the tengu here is already stressed out over his return to the mountain.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:40.210
Shut up.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.460
I...

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.450
really like you, Tomoe.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.060
So...

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.580
I'm really happy that the one taking Nanami from here

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.630
is you.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:08.130
<i>Our last night at the Mikage shrine was quiet and very warm.</i>

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.300
<i>This was the first room I could call my own.</i>

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:15.740
<i>I never felt lonely even when I was alone.</i>

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.790
<i>I loved everyone here.</i>

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.320
<i>Everyone loved me back.</i>

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:23.000
<i>They supported me with kindness.</i>

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:28.580
<i>They're all seeing me off now. This family of mine.</i>

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.760
Thank you for everything.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.620
We're graduating!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.620
I won't be a high school girl anymore.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.610
We had a fun high school life.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.020
Yeah, it was really fun!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.650
Nanami!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.740
I've come to pick you up!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.910
Mizuki! Not in a place like this!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.780
It's fine, humans can't see that hole.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.190
Tomoe, what about your buttons?

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.160
The girls tore them off.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.480
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.620
Let's go, Nanami!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.420
Yeah!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.860
See you later, guys!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.360
Have fun!

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:09.520
<i>The human world and the spirit world.</i>

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:13.670
<i>This will be my last time going between them.</i>

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.860
Hey, this is an awfully complicated path.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.390
Who came up with it?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.330
I did!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.100
It's no fun if we get there straight away.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.930
Don't you know about the procession ceremony?

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:26.690
The procession ceremony?

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.440
Come, Lady Nanami.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:34.200
We maid-servants of the swamp will prepare you for the wedding.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.200
Nanami, see you later!

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:41.150
<i>Yes, this is the last night as spirits</i>

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>for Tomoe and me.</i>

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.580
Nanami...

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.630
You're beautiful.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.500
Got something to say?

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:03.040
Well, whatever. You probably don't care about how I look dressed up as a bride, anyway.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:10.110
You're finally mine.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.300
<i>I promise.</i>

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.570
<i>Someday in the future, I will become your wife.</i>

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.570
Tomoe...

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:26.960
<i>I'm going...</i>

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.020
<i>to become his wife.</i>

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.720
Let's go, you two.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.620
Everyone's waiting.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:48.030
I made a promise to give you a single flower petal

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:53.980
Before this fleeting dream completely disappeared

00:09:53.980 --> 00:10:00.060
You call my name and stroke my cheek

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:06.110
Countless months pass with your hand at my side

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:16.660
Without saying a word you straightened out my unruly hair for me

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.360
Remember?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:27.630
Divine words of cherry blossoms, a chance encounter

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.960
Nanami, what's wrong? Does your stomach hurt?

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:33.400
I was chasing after you from behind

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.270
I don't know what to do, Tomoe.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:34.160
I wish time would just stop.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:39.540
All to see your kind eyes as you turn toward me

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.560
I don't want this moment to pass.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.360
What if...

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:45.670
If I stretched a little more I felt like I could reach

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.680
What if this is the happiest I'll ever be?

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:51.550
Even that distance was dear to me

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:51.790
There's more coming.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:57.820
My feelings grow stronger every day as I hold you close

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:56.550
You'll become even happier from now on.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.500
I am going to make you happy.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:06.480
You bring color to every spring for me

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:09.670
Come, let's go.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:15.770
Days spent like in a fever, and days of raging wind

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.040
Let's go.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:18.010
<i>This is the promise of a bond that runs so, so deep.</i>

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:21.790
They make the flowers take on all the colors of the world

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:22.010
<i>Two strands of fates chanced upon each other,</i>

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:27.890
We'll quarrel with each other, only to grow closer again

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.860
<i>became intertwined,</i>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.160
<i>and formed a knot.</i>

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:28.560
<i>In order to see where it all leads,</i>

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:33.880
By the time we notice we're holding each other's hands

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:31.350
<i>let's all go together.</i>

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:55.330
A single cherry blossom rocking on the tears

00:11:55.330 --> 00:12:01.080
When the faint drops have dried

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:07.380
I'll go meet you as a new me

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:13.440
Your flowing hair, your foul mouth

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:19.220
Even your awkward smile is dear to me

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:25.540
My feelings grow stronger as they dance across the sky

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:33.840
Countless springs are swaying
